72.697251	Minimal fixes:  
72.697253	1. Add bounds check: `if (expert_id * PER_EXPERT + PER_EXPERT > file_size) return;`.  
72.697255	2. Use atomic write or version tag for `slot_expert`.  
72.697280	3. Align copies via `memcpy` or `std::copy`.
